# …except the bh-delivery profile: CI and scripts/kit-root.sh read kit_version from it,
# so it has to be in the tree. A parent-directory ignore cannot be un-ignored per file,
# which is why the pattern above is .claude/* and not .claude/.
!.claude/delivery-profile.yaml
# …and the project instructions, which every checkout and sandbox needs, not just this
# machine. They were untracked, so a fresh clone had none of them.
!.claude/CLAUDE.md

